# Normalize line endings: the repo is developed on Windows but runs on Colab (Linux).
# Text files are stored with LF in the repo and checked out with the platform's native EOL.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows-only helper scripts keep CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Treat notebooks as text so diffs work, but don't let editors reformat them.
*.ipynb text eol=lf
# The pretrained encoders (~294 MB across 10 files) are published as GitHub Release assets
# rather than committed here -- see tools/release_weights.sh and README.md. They used to be
# tracked via Git LFS, but LFS's 1 GB/month free bandwidth quota made the download 404 after
# only a few clones or Colab runs; Release assets have no such quota.
# Binary assets -- never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pth binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.pt binary
